Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.16,0:00:08.72,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Handler One to Undertaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.72,0:00:13.37,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Multiple enemy interceptor groups \Nat points 30 and 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.37,0:00:17.96,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Battalion-sized units \Nof Löwes and Grauwolfs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.29,0:00:21.59,Italics,H,0,0,0,,All units, advance immediately \Nand take them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:28.29,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Though, with that many of them, \NI bet you're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:32.82,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Go! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.82,0:00:34.82,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Go, pigs!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:40.62,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Fight until you break, Eighty-Six!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.13,0:00:49.65,Italics,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.45,0:00:54.03,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.03,0:00:55.95,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Stop it! Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.59,0:00:58.98,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Shut up! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.07,0:01:38.07,sign_2280_13_Stellar_Year_214,H,0,0,0,,May 13th, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:59.86,Italics,Weather,0,0,0,,As you can see, it's another beautiful day today \Nin all 85 districts around the country!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.18,0:02:03.15,Italics,Weather,0,0,0,,Why not go out with your friends \Nand family today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.15,0:02:08.31,Italics,Weather,0,0,0,,The weather will be a little worse tomorrow, \Nbut you won't need an umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:11.27,Italics,Weather,0,0,0,,Have a great weekend, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.69,0:02:17.56,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,Now for today's update on the war \Nfrom San Magnolia Military HQ!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.49,0:02:22.28,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,The Legion mechanized infantry drones
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.28,0:02:25.39,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,belonging to the Giadian Empire \Nthat invaded Combat District 17
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.39,0:02:28.75,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,took severe damage from our own\N nation's unmanned combat units—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:31.08,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,the Juggernauts—\Nand were forced to withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.08,0:02:34.99,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,Damage taken by our side was minimal, \Nwith no human injuries or fatalities!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.36,0:02:38.60,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,Combat via highly advanced, \Nethically responsible drones
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.87,0:02:41.85,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,has resulted in zero fatalities on our side!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.27,0:02:46.01,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,The day when our nation's righteousness \Nfinally smashes the evil remnants
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.01,0:02:47.72,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,of the wicked Empire is not far off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.26,0:02:50.42,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,Glory to the Republic of San Magnolia,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.42,0:02:52.56,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,and to the five-color flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.19,0:02:57.69,sign_4201_30_San_Magnolia_Mil,Announcer,0,0,0,,San Magnolia Military HQ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.44,0:03:06.50,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Morning, Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.48,0:03:14.64,Main,Sanders,0,0,0,,Those pigs sure were crying \Ntheir heads off yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.91,0:03:18.04,Main,John,0,0,0,,It was a pretty crazy fight. \NI bet at least five of them died.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.04,0:03:20.09,Main,Tom,0,0,0,,Not that any people were on board!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.03,0:03:26.10,Main,Sanders,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody! \NThe doll-loving princess is glaring at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.10,0:03:29.82,Main,Tom,0,0,0,,Why do you look so sad, Major Milizé?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.82,0:03:32.60,Main,Tom,0,0,0,,It's just a few busted-up drones!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.29,0:03:34.29,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,Listen, you—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.29,0:03:35.33,Main,Anette,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.33,0:03:37.16,Main,L,0,0,0,,Morning, Annette.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.16,0:03:40.11,Main,L,0,0,0,,You're up early. You normally sleep in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.11,0:03:42.32,Main,A,0,0,0,,I was up working all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.32,0:03:44.62,Main,A,0,0,0,,Not like those morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.53,0:03:47.44,Main,A,0,0,0,,Forget them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.82,0:03:50.43,Main,A,0,0,0,,This isn't the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.43,0:03:51.84,Main,A,0,0,0,,We're inside the Gran Mur.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.84,0:03:54.28,Main,A,0,0,0,,And the enemy will be gone in two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.28,0:03:58.59,Main,A,0,0,0,,If anything, you're the weirdo \Nfor taking it seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.77,0:04:01.04,Main,L,0,0,0,,I just think this country's \Nconscience has—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.04,0:04:03.28,Main,A,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.28,0:04:06.20,Main,A,0,0,0,,I'm not awake enough \Nto listen to your speeches.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.56,0:04:11.21,Main,SoldierB,0,0,0,,What's that Processor's problem? \NHe's just a part!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.21,0:04:12.53,Main,SoldierC,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.53,0:04:17.73,Main,SoldierC,0,0,0,,We're from District 1. Why do we have to listen \Nto bitching from the pigs in District 86?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.92,0:04:27.44,Main,A,0,0,0,,Why do you care so much \Nabout the drones, Lena?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.80,0:04:30.53,Main,L,0,0,0,,They're not drones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.65,0:04:33.48,Main,A,0,0,0,,I'll try again, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.48,0:04:37.42,Main,A,0,0,0,,Why do you care so much about the Eighty-Six?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.07,0:04:48.34,Main,A,0,0,0,,The battlefield calls, milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.44,0:05:09.93,Main,L,0,0,0,,Initiate ID confirmation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.93,0:05:14.00,Main,L,0,0,0,,Major Vladilena Milizé. \NEastern Theater Forces, Combat District 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.00,0:05:16.39,Main,L,0,0,0,,Defense Line 3 Unit Command\N and Control Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.79,0:05:32.98,Main,L,0,0,0,,Activate Para-RAID. \NSynchronization target: Pleiades Processor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.97,0:05:37.28,Main,L,0,0,0,,Synchronization complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.87,0:05:39.87,Main,L,0,0,0,,Handler One to Pleiades:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.26,0:05:42.36,Main,L,0,0,0,,Glad to be working with you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.53,0:05:45.50,Italics,P,0,0,0,,Pleiades to Handler One:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.79,0:05:47.20,Italics,P,0,0,0,,Synchronization channel clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.29,0:05:52.11,Main,L,0,0,0,,Be careful. \NThe enemy's entering firing range.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.11,0:05:53.04,Main,L,0,0,0,,Be careful—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:57.79,Italics,P,0,0,0,,Every time, you're so kind \Nto us inhuman Eighty-Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.40,0:06:02.01,Italics,P,0,0,0,,It's very sweet, human lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.73,0:06:11.17,Main,L,0,0,0,,You're changing my assigned unit, \NGeneral Karlstahl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.17,0:06:16.69,Main,K,0,0,0,,Yes, one of the unit's Handlers \Nis retiring from his post.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.69,0:06:21.24,Main,K,0,0,0,,As such, a new one is needed immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.24,0:06:24.15,Main,L,0,0,0,,If they can't leave their post \Nuntil a successor is decided,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.15,0:06:26.34,Main,L,0,0,0,,does that mean it's a unit \Ndefending an important base?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:30.32,Main,K,0,0,0,,Yes, Defense Line 1 in\NEastern Defense Line Combat District 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.57,0:06:32.98,Main,K,0,0,0,,AKA the Spearhead Squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.38,0:06:36.72,Main,K,0,0,0,,It's comprised of veterans \Nfrom all across the eastern theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.72,0:06:39.04,Main,K,0,0,0,,An ace unit, you could say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:40.28,Main,L,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.28,0:06:44.21,Main,L,0,0,0,,I'm a new major. \NI don't think I could handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.21,0:06:48.56,Main,K,0,0,0,,And you're also the youngest person ever \Nto make it to the post of major.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.56,0:06:51.96,Main,K,0,0,0,,If you try to be too humble, \Nyou'll make unnecessary enemies, Lena.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.91,0:06:55.40,Main,L,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Uncle Jérôme.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.74,0:07:01.16,Main,K,0,0,0,,I'm sure Václav would be proud \Nif he could see his daughter, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.14,0:07:04.43,Main,K,0,0,0,,How is Margareta?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.63,0:07:08.55,Main,L,0,0,0,,The same as ever. She won't stop \Ntelling me to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.55,0:07:10.01,Main,K,0,0,0,,I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.41,0:07:13.38,Main,K,0,0,0,,Actually, we can't find anyone \Nwilling to take on the role.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.65,0:07:15.86,Main,L,0,0,0,,They're an ace unit, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.86,0:07:20.93,Main,L,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be an honor for any\N Republic soldier to command them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.93,0:07:25.13,Main,K,0,0,0,,Yes, that's true for the unit itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.13,0:07:29.58,Main,K,0,0,0,,Its commander unit's name: Undertaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.58,0:07:31.92,Main,K,0,0,0,,There's a story behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.92,0:07:32.73,Main,L,0,0,0,,A story?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.31,0:07:35.47,Main,K,0,0,0,,They call it the Reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.99,0:07:39.83,Main,K,0,0,0,,It destroys any Handler \Nwho tries to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.82,0:07:43.15,Main,L,0,0,0,,The Processor destroys the Handler?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.15,0:07:44.26,Main,L,0,0,0,,Not the other way around?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.26,0:07:45.03,Main,K,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.34,0:07:47.57,Main,L,0,0,0,,It's not just a ghost story?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.57,0:07:52.03,Main,K,0,0,0,,I don't have time in my schedule \Nto share ghost stories with my subordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.03,0:07:58.57,Main,K,0,0,0,,Almost all Handlers for the unit with Undertaker \Nin them request to retire or change units.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.82,0:08:00.79,Main,K,0,0,0,,Some have even committed suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.67,0:08:03.80,Main,K,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.11,0:08:07.37,Main,K,0,0,0,,but they say they're haunted \Nby the "voices of the dead."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.91,0:08:08.98,Main,L,0,0,0,,The dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.04,0:08:12.90,Main,K,0,0,0,,You're free to refuse, Lena.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.20,0:08:15.13,Main,K,0,0,0,,You work too hard, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.13,0:08:17.96,Main,K,0,0,0,,A Handler's job is to monitor the unit, \Nkeep their commands to a minimum,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.96,0:08:19.47,Main,K,0,0,0,,and let the local commander take control.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.47,0:08:20.33,Main,L,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:24.14,Main,L,0,0,0,,I'll give my all to managing Spearhead\N and being its Command and Control Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.74,0:08:27.63,Main,K,0,0,0,,You don't need to do more than your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.63,0:08:31.17,Main,K,0,0,0,,Stop trying to interact with the Processors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:33.94,Main,L,0,0,0,,It's a commander's job to know her men.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:37.83,Main,K,0,0,0,,Well, while I'm lecturing you, \Nlet me add one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.12,0:08:41.92,Main,K,0,0,0,,Stop putting the number of fatalities \Nin your reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.92,0:08:45.38,Main,K,0,0,0,,Officially, there are no humans \Non the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.25,0:08:48.71,Main,K,0,0,0,,So there are no fatalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.71,0:08:51.02,Main,L,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean we can ignore them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.02,0:08:53.38,Main,L,0,0,0,,What we're doing shouldn't even be allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.38,0:08:54.08,Main,K,0,0,0,,Lena.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.17,0:08:59.84,Main,K,0,0,0,,You really are just like Václav.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.83,0:09:03.84,Main,K,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.11,0:09:07.77,Main,K,0,0,0,,I appoint you, Vladilena Milizé, Handler—\Nthat is, Command and Control Officer—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.77,0:09:10.91,Main,K,0,0,0,,for Defense Line Combat District 1, \NDefense Line 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.91,0:09:13.45,Main,K,0,0,0,,Have the paperwork done \Nby the time you get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.15,0:09:15.10,Main,K,0,0,0,,And do your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.28,0:09:19.30,Main,L,0,0,0,,I'll do my best until my final mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.23,0:09:22.11,Italics,A,0,0,0,,And you accepted it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:26.50,sign_13517_134_Republic_of_San_,A,0,0,0,,Republic of San Magnolia Military Research Wing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.77,0:09:26.49,Italics Top,A,0,0,0,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.49,0:09:29.23,Italics Top,A,0,0,0,,You're such a weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.23,0:09:31.86,Main,L,0,0,0,,It's an honor to be put in charge \Nof an ace unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:33.22,Main,L,0,0,0,,And it's an important job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:36.86,Main,L,0,0,0,,And that stuff about it destroying Handlers \Nis all lies, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.86,0:09:40.14,Main,L,0,0,0,,I bet they all just don't care about their jobs, \Nso they lied to get out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:42.36,Italics,A,0,0,0,,It's true that some committed suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.22,0:09:49.18,Italics,A,0,0,0,,One of Spearhead's Handlers went crazy \Nand blew his own head off with a shotgun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:52.43,Italics,A,0,0,0,,OK, exam's done. No problems, as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.83,0:09:54.33,Italics,A,0,0,0,,Thanks for your cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.14,0:09:58.31,Main,L,0,0,0,,But why commit suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.31,0:10:00.23,Italics,A,0,0,0,,We got a request to look into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:02.70,Italics,A,0,0,0,,They thought it might be a problem \Nwith the Para-RAID.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:04.37,Italics,A,0,0,0,,Quitting isn't a big deal,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.37,0:10:06.75,Italics,A,0,0,0,,but a suicide needs to be looked into.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.01,0:10:08.16,Main,L,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.16,0:10:08.96,Italics,A,0,0,0,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:10.33,Main,L,0,0,0,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.33,0:10:14.18,Italics,A,0,0,0,,The Handler was dead. \NHow we were supposed to investigate it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.44,0:10:17.05,Main,L,0,0,0,,You're the leader of the development team. \NIs that really okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.05,0:10:18.80,Main,A,0,0,0,,We did our jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.80,0:10:22.34,Main,A,0,0,0,,There was nothing wrong \Nwith the RAID Device. End of story.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.34,0:10:26.38,Main,A,0,0,0,,We told them that if they wanted to know more,\N they'd have to bring us the Undertaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.70,0:10:32.27,Main,A,0,0,0,,But those idiots in transport said, \N"This flight has no seats open for pigs!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.37,0:10:35.88,Main,L,0,0,0,,Then you didn't talk to Undertaker?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:37.18,Main,A,0,0,0,,We just read the report.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.18,0:10:39.31,Main,A,0,0,0,,"No idea," they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.31,0:10:42.81,Main,A,0,0,0,,We told them about the dead Handler, \Nand all they said was, "I see."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:45.36,Main,A,0,0,0,,Well, they're an Eighty-Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.84,0:10:50.40,Main,A,0,0,0,,It's not outside the realm of possibility \Nthat a Para-RAID could cause insanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.40,0:10:52.72,Main,A,0,0,0,,You're putting extra pressure \Non part of the brain to allow it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.72,0:10:54.64,Main,A,0,0,0,,to share sensory data \Nwith a completely different person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.91,0:10:57.97,Main,A,0,0,0,,And we use it only to share hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.97,0:11:00.90,Main,A,0,0,0,,If you tried to synchronize vision as well, \Nit would burn out your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:04.09,Main,A,0,0,0,,Too much load on the brain, \Nand you don't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:08.89,Main,A,0,0,0,,Using the Para-RAID \Nmeans accepting those risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.46,0:11:15.40,Main,L,0,0,0,,But your father was one of the authorities \Nin this field of research.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:18.64,Main,A,0,0,0,,The fundamental principles \Nwere all developed by someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.95,0:11:21.75,Main,A,0,0,0,,There's a lot I don't know, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.94,0:11:26.06,Main,A,0,0,0,,Listen, Lena, you should join us in R&D.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.35,0:11:29.04,Main,A,0,0,0,,The military's just a jobs program right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:31.07,Main,A,0,0,0,,When the Legion are gone in two years,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.07,0:11:33.81,Main,A,0,0,0,,"former military" isn't going \Nto mean a thing on your résumé.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.35,0:11:35.56,Main,L,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.56,0:11:37.21,Main,L,0,0,0,,But it's wartime right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.21,0:11:39.61,Main,A,0,0,0,,Those Processors are crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:41.93,Main,A,0,0,0,,You don't know what will happen \Nwith the Para-RAIDs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.93,0:11:44.43,Main,A,0,0,0,,The Eighty-Six die quickly anyway, \Nso it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.74,0:11:46.39,Main,A,0,0,0,,But I don't want that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.39,0:11:48.82,Main,L,0,0,0,,But, still, it's cowardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:52.67,Main,A,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.68,0:11:56.29,Main,A,0,0,0,,You really are weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.08,0:12:01.03,Main,A,0,0,0,,I changed the settings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.38,0:12:02.35,Main,L,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.35,0:12:05.09,Main,A,0,0,0,,Oh, Lena! I made chiffon cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.09,0:12:06.14,Main,A,0,0,0,,Want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:09.44,Main,L,0,0,0,,Hm... I'll pass today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.44,0:12:10.27,Main,L,0,0,0,,I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.27,0:12:12.34,Main,A,0,0,0,,I used real eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.82,0:12:16.08,Main,A,0,0,0,,And real milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.22,0:12:20.97,Main,L,0,0,0,,It's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.25,0:12:24.56,Main,A,0,0,0,,How's it feel to actually eat \Nthe real thing for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.56,0:12:25.94,Main,L,0,0,0,,Wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.94,0:12:28.59,Main,L,0,0,0,,But part of me wonders \Nif this is how it really tasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.24,0:12:32.17,Main,L,0,0,0,,You forget when you eat only artificial stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.99,0:12:35.19,Main,A,0,0,0,,I've got cream puffs, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.01,0:12:39.38,Main,L,0,0,0,,They don't taste like cheese \Nwhen they don't have cheese in them,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.38,0:12:42.48,Main,L,0,0,0,,or look like they're about \Nto spit out black smoke, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.48,0:12:47.12,Main,A,0,0,0,,Are you talking about the cream puffs \NI made last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.29,0:12:51.82,Main,A,0,0,0,,It'll be fine, this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.10,0:12:55.99,Main,A,0,0,0,,I gave some to a potential marriage partner \Nyesterday, and he cried tears of joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.99,0:12:58.00,Main,L,0,0,0,,Sounds like you got a good match for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.00,0:13:00.24,Main,L,0,0,0,,He must've really loved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.24,0:13:01.63,Main,A,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.63,0:13:06.79,Main,A,0,0,0,,I added a card with a lipstick kiss \Nand the words, "To My Beloved."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.79,0:13:09.87,Main,A,0,0,0,,I dropped them both in the mailbox of the place\N where he lives with his mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.10,0:13:19.36,sign_19088_211_Stellar_Year_214,A,0,0,0,,May 20th, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.29,0:13:17.98,Main Top,L,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Pleiades?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.98,0:13:19.35,Main Top,L,0,0,0,,Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.53,0:13:20.80,Main,L,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.26,0:13:22.88,Main,L,0,0,0,,Handler One to Pleiades!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:23.86,Italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.77,0:13:26.04,Italics,Voice,0,0,0,,He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.89,0:13:35.62,Italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Evasive maneuvers!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.62,0:13:37.30,Italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:41.57,Main,L,0,0,0,,Handler One to all members of Squadron 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.42,0:13:44.79,Main,L,0,0,0,,The enemy unit has begun its retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.15,0:13:48.01,Main,L,0,0,0,,Squadron 4 will take over \Nthe patrol mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.31,0:13:50.83,Main,L,0,0,0,,Return to base.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:52.34,Italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.99,0:13:58.32,Main,L,0,0,0,,Pleiades and the other six who died...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.84,0:14:02.04,Main,L,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.87,0:14:08.73,Italics,Voice,0,0,0,,As always, thank you \Nfor your kind words, Handler One.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.91,0:14:12.40,Main,L,0,0,0,,Just so you're aware,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.40,0:14:17.98,Main,L,0,0,0,,Squadron 3 will be re-formed \Nwith a new Handler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.81,0:14:20.94,Main,L,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.30,0:14:27.02,Main,L,0,0,0,,I'm going to be the Command \Nand Control Officer for Spearhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.95,0:14:29.89,Italics,Voice,0,0,0,,That's great news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:34.29,Italics,Voice,0,0,0,,You have my deepest sympathies, Handler One.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.29,0:14:35.35,Main,L,0,0,0,,What does that mean—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.35,0:14:36.67,Italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Say hello to the Reaper for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.94,0:14:46.65,sign_21170_236_Stellar_Year_214,Voice,0,0,0,,{\fad(1318,1)}May 22nd, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.95,0:15:02.93,Main,L,0,0,0,,Para-RAID, activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:05.51,Main,L,0,0,0,,Synchronization target:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.34,0:15:13.08,Main,L,0,0,0,,Spearhead Processor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.06,0:15:43.06,sign_21170_236_Stellar_Year_214,Voice,0,0,0,,May 12th, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.25,0:15:46.84,Main,Men,0,0,0,,Nice, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.85,0:15:51.81,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Get cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.58,0:16:02.74,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,They're having a good time over there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.74,0:16:05.35,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.67,0:16:10.46,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Eggs!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.36,0:16:14.64,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.48,0:16:18.30,Main,K,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.67,0:16:22.20,Main,Lecca,0,0,0,,Hey, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.47,0:16:23.89,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.54,0:16:28.64,Main,Kujo,0,0,0,,And, done!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.83,0:16:31.87,Main,Kujo,0,0,0,,Hey, have fun out there today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.87,0:16:33.87,Main,Man,0,0,0,,You mean, "Have fun out there, {\i1}sir{\i0}."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.65,0:16:57.62,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,Members of Spearhead, it's breakfast time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.07,0:16:59.61,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,Gather round!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.61,0:17:00.93,Main,Men,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.93,0:17:02.34,Main,Men,0,0,0,,Coming, coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.34,0:17:04.70,Main,Men,0,0,0,,Morning! Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.70,0:17:05.60,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.70,0:17:15.55,Main,All,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.85,0:17:17.68,Main,D,0,0,0,,There are more omelets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.68,0:17:18.71,Main,K,0,0,0,,Gimme more!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.71,0:17:20.02,Main,D,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.02,0:17:22.17,Main,K,0,0,0,,Can't you chew your food?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.17,0:17:23.87,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Is it good, Kuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.87,0:17:24.76,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.32,0:17:30.02,Main,Kino,0,0,0,,Hey, our Handler went crazy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.02,0:17:31.94,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,The one in the battle yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.94,0:17:33.72,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,That one's not coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.72,0:17:36.66,Main,H,0,0,0,,I heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.66,0:17:39.06,Main,H,0,0,0,,"Stay away! Hey, stop!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.83,0:17:43.33,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Stop it, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.92,0:17:47.84,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,White Pig always does that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.32,0:17:51.29,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Whoever comes next, \Nthe same thing will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.53,0:17:52.41,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.64,0:17:57.39,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,But everybody was able \Nto go yesterday, right, Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.12,0:18:00.41,Main,S,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.00,0:18:05.42,Main,Kujo,0,0,0,,Well, if we're going to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:09.33,Main,Kujo,0,0,0,,we'd rather have our Reaper guide us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.96,0:18:14.79,Main,Kujo,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.36,0:18:16.13,Main,Kujo,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.03,0:18:23.79,sign_26423_279_Stellar_Year_214,Kujo,0,0,0,,May 22nd, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.65,0:18:38.92,Main,Kujo,0,0,0,,It hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.92,0:18:40.70,Main,Kujo,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.03,0:18:45.36,Main,Kujo,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.29,0:19:17.15,Italics,Kujo,0,0,0,,I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:41.33,Main,Kujo,0,0,0,,Shin...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:47.64,Main,Kujo,0,0,0,,Promise me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.63,0:19:51.90,Main,Kujo,0,0,0,,Don't forget...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.99,0:20:24.71,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Was Kujo able to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.10,0:20:25.81,Main,S,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.68,0:20:27.88,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,What about Brother's voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.05,0:20:29.86,Main,S,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.39,0:20:31.37,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.50,0:20:55.99,Main Top,D,0,0,0,,There's none left.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.08,0:20:59.57,Main Top,Haruto,0,0,0,,You suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.57,0:21:00.60,Main Top,Chise,0,0,0,,I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.44,0:21:26.08,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Handler One to all Spearhead units.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.73,0:21:31.80,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Greetings. I am your new \NCommand and Control officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.80,0:21:32.58,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,A woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.94,0:21:36.53,Italics,L,0,0,0,,I've contacted you tonight \Nto introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.23,0:21:41.96,Main,S,0,0,0,,Hello, Handler One.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.40,0:21:44.95,Main,S,0,0,0,,This is Spearhead Squadron's \Ncombat commander,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.95,0:21:47.28,Main,S,0,0,0,,Personal Name: Undertaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.85,0:21:50.66,Italics,S,0,0,0,,We've received word of a new Handler coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.01,0:21:52.67,Italics,S,0,0,0,,We look forward to working with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.81,0:21:56.41,Italics,L,0,0,0,,As do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.71,0:22:00.16,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Undertaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.30,0:23:37.65,Main,L,0,0,0,,Spearhead.
